        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 9.15 Each employer signatory to this agreement shall contribute three cents ($0.03) per hour, for all hours worked by all employees by this Agreement to the American Line Builders Administrative Maintenance Fund (ALBAMF).",
