        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 9.16 The fund shall be administered solely by the American Line Builders Chapter, National Electrical Contractors Association, Inc. and shall be utilized to pay for the administration cost of the labor contract administration including negotiations, labor relation, disputes and grievance representation performed on behalf of the signatory employers. In addition, all other administration functions required of the management such as service on all funds as required by federal law.",
            "block_bbox": [
                119,
